@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam defaultFontName Inter
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

rectangle "Markdown content\n(content/)" as Content
rectangle "Archetypes\n(archetypes/)" as Archetypes
rectangle "PlantUML sources\n(assets/plantuml/)" as PlantUML
rectangle "Build script\n(scripts/build-site.sh)" as Build
rectangle "Static site output\n(web/wwwroot/)" as Output
rectangle "Browser bundle\n(web/src/)" as JS

Content --> Build
Archetypes --> Build
PlantUML --> Build
Build --> Output
JS --> Output

note right of Build
  The build step renders SVG diagrams
  before Hugo publishes the site.
end note
@enduml
